  "body": "The post-merge batch gate fails on `main`.\n\n- Run: 44320796021\n- Commit: 8643d9bb7d6933c8c5935985034c26e82e58522f\n- Result: 874 steps, 4 failed. The log does not show the assertion text.\n\nFailed tests:\n\n1. app suite `first_part_programs`: `first_router_part_posts_the_shipped_program`\n2. app suite `thread_boss`: `an_external_m8_thread_verifies_clean_and_posts_helical_moves`\n3. app suite `thread_mill`: `a_multi_form_mill_threads_m8_clean_and_posts_helical_moves`\n4. ui suite `lib`: `egui_app::tests::guide_projects::demo_projects_build_and_load_with_valid_paths`\n\nThe last run that did not fail on these tests was on 4cab68f97. Later runs stopped at the build.\n\nMerges since 4cab68f97 (suspects): #2522, #2510, #2498, #2513, #2504 (drill break-through reference, project format v68), #2465, #2527, #2531 (LF line endings for the shipped example NC programs), #2530, #2534, #2460 (whole-model contour bands), #2536.\n\nDone means: the four tests pass on `main`, and the post-merge gate is green. Each fix explains the cause and the merge that caused it.\n",
